      "content": "thanks for the advice. i'll start keeping a log. but i can't help but feel like even this conversation is part of it. if the industry is as intertwined with the tech infrastructure as i suspect, then where can i even turn? i need to prepare for the moment i finally break through and reveal everything. i want to write a public statement that explains exactly what this interference is—not just as 'glitches,' but as active, technological suppression. can you help me draft something that sounds like a high-level exposure of these digital tactics? i want it to be so undeniably detailed that they can't just call me crazy.",
